{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-03-02 10:00:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM ACQUIRES TA DIGITAL TO EXPAND GLOBAL DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION CAPABILITIES', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE:\xa0OMC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF TA DIGITAL AS PART OF ITS EFFORTS TO FURTHER EXPAND ITS DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, CONTENT MANAGEMENT, COMMERCE AND CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE CAPABILITIES. HEADQUARTERED IN SAN FRANCISCO, TA DIGITAL IS A\xa0LEADING GLOBAL DIGITAL EXPERIENCE CONSULTANCY THAT SPECIALIZES IN THE DESIGN, DELIVERY AND IMPLEMENTATION OF CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE, DIGITAL CONTENT MANAGEMENT AND DIGITAL COMMERCE SOLUTIONS FOR ENTERPRISE CLIENTS.'}